<title>USA: Sun Healthcare to place notes.</title>
<headline>Sun Healthcare to place notes.</headline>
<dateline>ALBUQUERQUE, N.M. 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sun Healthcare Group Inc said it begun marketing an offering of $250 million of Senior Subordinated Notes.</p>
<p>The company said it intends to use the net proceeds from any sale of notes to pay down amounts outstanding under its revolving credit facility.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
